       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ALLPROBE1.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  IF-D33 PICTURE X(4).
           88 D VALUE ALL "BAC".
           88 E VALUE ALL "B".
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE "BACB" TO IF-D33.
           IF D OF IF-D33 DISPLAY "A01 Y" ELSE DISPLAY "A01 N".
           IF IF-D33 = ALL "BAC" DISPLAY "A02 Y" ELSE DISPLAY "A02 N".
           MOVE "BBBB" TO IF-D33.
           IF E DISPLAY "A03 Y" ELSE DISPLAY "A03 N".
           MOVE "BAC " TO IF-D33.
           IF D DISPLAY "A04 Y" ELSE DISPLAY "A04 N".
           STOP RUN.
